    "core:description": "espsdrtx Packet example on an ESP32-C3 board (QFN32 rev v0.4, chip antenna): QPSK, 5 Msym/s (16 samples per symbol at 80 MS/s), RRC 0.35, rms word 25, payload 'hello from espsdrtx', sequence 0; one 3200-sample (40 us) loop repeated. Carrier 2442 MHz (the board's crystal ran about 21.6 kHz high against the HackRF); HackRF centred at 2440 MHz, so the packet is centred at +2 MHz. Recorded at higher HackRF gain than the other recordings, since this board's signal arrived about 20 dB weaker. packet_qpsk_reference.cs16 holds the same loop built on a PC by espsdrtx_sc_packet (int16 I/Q, 80 MS/s).",
